CLASS net/minecraft/world/entity/Entity
	FIELD uuid Ljava/util/UUID;
		COMMENT A [java.util.UUID] used to distinguish between different instances of Entity.
	METHOD discard ()V
		COMMENT Removes this Entity from the [net.minecraft.world.level.Level] it is in.
		COMMENT
		COMMENT The Entity ceases all interactions with the rest of the Level and is not saved to Level data.
	METHOD entityTags ()Ljava/util/Set;
		COMMENT Returns this Entity's tags.
		COMMENT @see net.minecraft.server.commands.TagCommand
	METHOD getTeamColor ()I
		COMMENT Returns the color associated with the [net.minecraft.world.scores.Team] this Entity is part of in the `0xRRGGBB` format.
		COMMENT @return the team color in the `0xRRGGBB` format, or [net.minecraft.util.CommonColors#WHITE] if the Entity is not part of a Team or the Team has no color
	METHOD kill (Lnet/minecraft/server/level/ServerLevel;)V
		COMMENT Kills this Entity.
		COMMENT
		COMMENT This removes the Entity from the [net.minecraft.world.level.Level] it is in.
		COMMENT The Entity ceases all interactions with the rest of the Level and is not saved to Level data.
		COMMENT
		COMMENT Additionally, [net.minecraft.world.level.gameevent.GameEvent#ENTITY_DIE] is broadcast.
	CLASS RemovalReason
		COMMENT Reasons an [net.minecraft.world.entity.Entity] is removed from a [net.minecraft.world.level.Level].
